# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

# Version file for dynamic versioning
#  Comment this out to if you do not want to use dynamic versioning and
#  would like to manually change the __version__.py file (not recommended).
#  However, when using dynamic versioning (recommended), this file will be autogenerated
#  in the pipeline, and should not be written by developer
*__version__.py

